WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Every wall has a consequence.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Unfinished halves are vulnerable while they grow.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Both halves hit. Two lives lost. No square closes.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.050
Watch the top connect while the lower half grows.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:14.000
The lower half is hit. The connected half stays.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.850
Balls can still pass around the unfinished gap.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:22.467
Watch both halves reach a boundary.

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:27.000
Connected from edge to edge. Balls stay on each side.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.183
Now close the top-left square.

00:00:29.183 --> 00:00:35.000
Trapped. These balls rebound inside the square.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.183
An occupied square stays dark. The balls keep moving.

00:00:42.183 --> 00:00:44.800
A second divider grows across the board.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.000
The divider is solid. Next, close the square.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.400
Both halves connect to the existing walls.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:58.000
Two balls in each square. Neither pair can escape.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.817
Seal the empty strip at the bottom-left.

00:01:00.817 --> 00:01:06.000
Empty space turns red and adds to your captured area.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.817
Trap the balls. Claim the empty space.
